  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Firing or swinging the weapon grants a stack of Nadir Focus for 2 seconds. Stowing the weapon removes the buff.\n\nMaximum number of Stacks by Weapon Type:\n• Auto Rifles, Submachine Guns?: 11 stacks\n• Sidearms, Swords: 5 stacks\n• Hand Cannons, Scout Rifles: 4 stacks\n• Grenade Launchers: ? stacks\n\nBenefits scale linearly? with each stack, equalizing between Weapon Types at max stacks. (E.g.: you would gain 1/4 of the maximum benefit per stack with Hand Cannons)\n\nBenefits at max Stacks:\n• 10 Range\n• 7.5%? decreased Accuracy Cone Size\n• 100%? increased Lunge Distance (Swords)\n• ?% increased Projectile Velocity (Grenade Launchers)",
      "updatedAt": "2025-12-27T23:26:44.825Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
