      "plain": "Upon firing a weapon or swinging a sword:\nGrants stacks of Nadir Focus for 2 seconds, up to 12 stacks.\nNadir Focus linearly grants up to +10 ↑+11 Range, -5% ↑-5.5% Accuracy Cone Size, +20 ↑+22 Velocity, and 100% ↑110% Increased Sword Lunge Distance.\nFiring or swinging refreshes the buff duration. \nBuff is removed on stow. Stack amount varies \n\nNADIR Focus\nAuto Rifles, Submachine Guns = +1 per shot, reaches maximum after 12. (+8.34% Effect per shot)\nPulse Rifles, Sidearms | +2 per shot, reaches maximum after 6. (+16.7% Effect per shot)\nEverything Else | +3 per shot, reaches maximum after 4 (+25% Effect per shot/swing)",
